{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.toru.bus",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "回程的公交上，她睡着了",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.toru.bus",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.toru.bus",
    "idolId": "toru",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——糟了。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "睡着了，抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦，没事，还早着呢吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……诶，已经到二手店那里了。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "公交的话，很快就到。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个……是吗，我记得还有三站左右。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——是吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "什么叫是吗……哈哈，你不是每天都坐吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "今天是从反方向坐的。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……这一带，会搞不清。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，也许吧。这一带景色都差不多。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "嗯。天黑了更搞不清。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "只有窗户亮着，一直只有窗户连着。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "会变成『这里原来是这样的啊』——",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯——",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我也许现在才发现，窗户居然这样……居然住了这么多人。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这一带，因为你们住着，我才经常经过——",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "之前一直没看见。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……啊——",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……下一站要下吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——诶，你按了？",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "按了啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "诶，我想按的。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶诶！……这个，能取消吗——",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "不行吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "呼，亮得好厉害。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……对、对不起……",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "好想按啊——",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……呜。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——这个也是，原来这么亮啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？啊……是说停车按钮？",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——哈哈，好漂亮。像萤火虫。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "白天亮着的东西看不见呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "明明晚上能看见。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……白天亮着的东西——？",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……——",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "以前没在意过，不过这个，亮得好厉害——",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "这一带，住了好多人。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……我啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……不。",
        "nextNodeId": "48"
      },
      "48": {
        "id": "48",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "能好好说出来吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "49"
      },
      "49": {
        "id": "49",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那些亮着的东西——白天也一直亮着的东西。",
        "nextNodeId": "50"
      },
      "50": {
        "id": "50",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "下车了哦，制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "51"
      },
      "51": {
        "id": "51",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，好！",
        "nextNodeId": "52"
      },
      "52": {
        "id": "52",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……那个，就是——",
        "nextNodeId": "53"
      },
      "53": {
        "id": "53",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我，看得见。白天也亮着的东西。",
        "nextNodeId": "54"
      },
      "54": {
        "id": "54",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……？",
        "nextNodeId": "55"
      },
      "55": {
        "id": "55",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……亮着的东西就是亮着的。",
        "nextNodeId": "56"
      },
      "56": {
        "id": "56",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——嘿……",
        "nextNodeId": "57"
      },
      "57": {
        "id": "57",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "58"
      },
      "58": {
        "id": "58",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "挺厉害的嘛。"
      }
    }
  },
